{
  "declaredLength": 5800,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "A que me lo he dejado en casa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100200071007500650020006D00650020006C006F002000680065002000640065006A00610064006F00200065006E00200063006100730061002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, ¿te puedo pedir un...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C002000BF0074006500200070007500650064006F00200070006500640069007200200075006E002E002E002E003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, déjalo. Se lo pediré a Anya.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006400E9006A0061006C006F002E0020005300650020006C006F00200070006500640069007200E90020006100200041006E00790061002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anya, ¿le puedo pedir un favorcito a Hoopa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00790061002C002000BF006C006500200070007500650064006F00200070006500640069007200200075006E0020006600610076006F0072006300690074006F0020006100200048006F006F00700061003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ni hablar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00690020006800610062006C00610072002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Eh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450068003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pedirle a Hoopa que recupere algo que te has\nolvidado es de ser vago y cutre, así que no.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jo, Anya... Hay que ver cómo eres.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006F002C00200041006E00790061002E002E002E0020004800610079002000710075006500200076006500720020006300F3006D006F00200065007200650073002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo solo le pido que me lleve de un hotel a otro\npara no preocupar a nadie de forma innecesaria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y, además, mi mamá siempre dice que ser un\ngandul es lo peor que hay.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002C0020006100640065006D00E10073002C0020006D00690020006D0061006D00E10020007300690065006D007000720065002000640069006300650020007100750065002000730065007200200075006E000A00670061006E00640075006C0020006500730020006C006F002000700065006F007200200071007500650020006800610079002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, lo mismo llevas algo de razón con que me\nestoy volviendo un poco holgazán.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Está bien! ¡Me ocuparé de mis propios asuntos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450073007400E10020006200690065006E0021002000A1004D00650020006F0063007500700061007200E90020006400650020006D00690073002000700072006F00700069006F00730020006100730075006E0074006F00730021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y, para acabar de motivarme... ¡Te reto a darlo\ntodo en un combate, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te espero fuera.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065002000650073007000650072006F002000660075006500720061002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tengo curiosidad por ver a Acris cuando se lo\ntoma en serio! Y tú también, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hoopaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006F007000610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Libra un combate contra mí, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006900620072006100200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E0074007200610020006D00ED002C002000100002010000000021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Acepto!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410063006500700074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un poco...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E00200070006F0063006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gane o pierda, lo importante para mí es ver hasta\ndónde soy capaz de llegar si me pongo en serio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero ver hasta dónde puedo llegar si me pongo\nen serio, y para eso nada mejor que un combate...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¡contra <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂella Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa más fuerte de la ciudad!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué bien! ¡Tengo ganas de ver lo fuerte que es\nsu Scrafty!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E90020006200690065006E0021002000A100540065006E0067006F002000670061006E0061007300200064006500200076006500720020006C006F00200066007500650072007400650020007100750065002000650073000A0073007500200053006300720061006600740079002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hoopaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006F007000610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scrafty, tú siempre has estado a mi lado.\n¡Ahora te ayudaré yo a que te luzcas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era de esperar. Pero estoy contento de haber\npodido medirme contra ti, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí! ¡Habéis estado geniales los dos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED0021002000A100480061006200E900690073002000650073007400610064006F002000670065006E00690061006C006500730020006C006F007300200064006F0073002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo que no entiendo es una cosa: con lo fuerte\nque eres, ¿de qué tienes miedo? ¿Por qué tanto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nreparo en volver a casa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con mi hermana no tengo problema, pero a mi\nabuela no quiero verla ni en pintura.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdón. Ha sido un comentario egoísta por mi\nparte. Sé que echas de menos a tu madre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si no quieres ver a tu abuela, no tienes por qué\nhacerlo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006E006F0020007100750069006500720065007300200076006500720020006100200074007500200061006200750065006C0061002C0020006E006F0020007400690065006E0065007300200070006F007200200071007500E9000A00680061006300650072006C006F002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Eh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450068003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, no esperaba esa respuesta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C0020006E006F00200065007300700065007200610062006100200065007300610020007200650073007000750065007300740061002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En lugar de perder el tiempo haciendo lo que no\nquieres, aprovéchalo para crecer y mejorar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si los demás lo aceptan, perfecto. Y si no,\ntampoco pierdes nada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006C006F0073002000640065006D00E100730020006C006F0020006100630065007000740061006E002C00200070006500720066006500630074006F002E002000590020007300690020006E006F002C000A00740061006D0070006F0063006F002000700069006500720064006500730020006E006100640061002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Scraf!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006300720061006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que Scrafty está de acuerdo contigo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610072006500630065002000710075006500200053006300720061006600740079002000650073007400E10020006400650020006100630075006500720064006F00200063006F006E007400690067006F002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muy bien. Lo primero que haré será centrarme en\nhacer feliz a mi hermana, que es el ojito derecho<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde mi abuela.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues yo también colaboraré. ¡Pienso prepararle\nun dónut especial que le va a encantar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así a lo mejor conseguimos que tu abuela\ncambie de opinión poco a poco!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Scraf!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006300720061006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy seguro de que, con mi talento, podré\nconseguir que cambie de opinión.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY si ella me acepta, yo también haré el esfuerzo\npara dejar de tenerle manía.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Enfrentarme a ti me ha devuelto la confianza,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006E006600720065006E007400610072006D0065002000610020007400690020006D0065002000680061002000640065007600750065006C0074006F0020006C006100200063006F006E006600690061006E007A0061002C000A00100002010000000021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te lo agradezco. ¡Seguiré persiguiendo mis\nsueños por mi hermana y por todos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Scraaaf!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300630072006100610061006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    }
  ],
